<section>
    <h2>Guide Mixins</h2>
    <p>Visual overlay mixins for development and layout debugging.</p>

    <h3>guide--baseline</h3>
    <p>Renders a baseline grid overlay for vertical-rhythm debugging.</p>

    <div class="api-signature">@include guide--baseline</div>

    <div class="code-block"><pre><code>// Apply to a layer element
.guide-overlay {
    @include guide--layer;
    @include guide--baseline;
}</code></pre></div>

    <h3>guide--graph / guide--graph_centered</h3>
    <p>Renders a graph (column) grid overlay. The <code>_centered</code> variant aligns the grid to the viewport
        center.</p>

    <div class="api-signature">@include guide--graph<br>@include guide--graph_centered</div>

    <div class="code-block"><pre><code>.guide-overlay {
    @include guide--layer;
    @include guide--graph_centered;
}</code></pre></div>

    <h3>guide--margin</h3>
    <p>Highlights margin areas for layout inspection.</p>

    <div class="api-signature">@include guide--margin</div>

    <div class="code-block"><pre><code>.guide-overlay {
    @include guide--layer;
    @include guide--margin;
}</code></pre></div>

    <h3>guide--layer</h3>
    <p>Base layer mixin -- positions the overlay element fixed across the viewport. Combine with one of the visual
        guides above.</p>

    <div class="api-signature">@include guide--layer</div>

    <h3>guide--centered</h3>
    <p>Centers a guide horizontally within its container.</p>

    <div class="api-signature">@include guide--centered</div>
</section>
